job_description:
Deskripsi Pekerjaan

Melakukan perencanaan & perancangan (desain) teknis bangunan terkait HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing sesuai standar yang berlaku;
Memahami gambar teknik dan prosedur pelaksanaan proyek konstruksi;
Melakukan inspeksi berkala dan pengecekan terakit instalasi HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing;
Melakukan survei lapangan untuk memperoleh data teknis & melakukan assisting pemasangan equipment & sistem HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing;


Kualifikasi

Lulusan SMK/D3 atau S1 Teknik (MEP)
Memiliki minimal 2 tahun pengalaman kerja di bidang yang sama
Memiliki pengetahuan mengenai HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing
Mampu bekerja sama dalam tim, tahan terhadap tekanan, komunikatif dan memiliki kemampuan problem solving yang baik.
Menguasai AutoCAD, SketchUp dan software perencana lainnya

Responsibilities :

Strategically manage warehouse in compliance with company’s policies and vision;

Oversee receiving, warehousing, distribution and maintenance operations;

Setup layout and ensure efficient space utilization;

Initiate, coordinate and enforce optimal operational policies and procedures;

Adhere to all warehousing, handling and shipping legislation requirements;

Maintain standards of health and safety, hygiene and security;

Manage stock control and reconcile with data storage system;

Prepare annual budget;

Liaise with clients, suppliers and transport companies;

Plan work rotas, assign tasks appropriately and appraise results;

Recruit, select, orient, coach and motivate employees;

Produce reports and statistics regularly (IN/OUT status report, dead stock report etc);

Receive feedback and monitor the quality of services provided.




Requirements :

Candidate must possess at least a Bachelor's Degree from Industry Engineering;

At least 5 year(s) of working experience in the related field is required for this position;

Proven work experience as a Warehouse Manager

Expertise in warehouse management procedures and best practices

Proven ability to implement process improvement initiatives

Strong knowledge of warehousing Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

Hands on experience with warehouse management software and databases

Leadership skills and ability manage staff

Strong decision making and problem solving skills

Excellent communication skills

BS degree in logistics, supply chain management or business administration

Iniative and problem solver;

Flexible on considering different realities;

Accountable, honest, and strong integrity;

Hard working, able to work as a team both external and internal across all function;

Understanding the SAP B1 system is an added value;

Good command in English, both written and spoken;

Responsible, proactive, having good manner, dynamic and outgoing personality;

Taking the initiative, problem detection, problem solving, and attention to detail;

Ready for placement in Banjarbaru, Kalimantan Selatan;

Responsibility:

1. Responsible for quality control throughout the entire process of incoming materials, in-process production, and finished products, ensuring compliance with quality standards and regulatory requirements;

2. Establish and maintain quality standards, inspection specifications, and related quality documentation systems;

3. Apply quality tools (e.g., QC seven tools) to perform problem analysis, drive abnormality closure, and promote continuous improvement;

4. Monitor key quality KPIs, conduct data analysis, and formulate improvement measures;

5. Participate in the validation of new products, new processes, and new materials introductions to ensure stable mass production quality;

6. Collaborate with production, process, equipment, and other departments to advance quality improvement projects and resolve on-site issues.




Qualification:

1. Bachelor's degree or above in quality, chemistry, materials, or engineering-related fields.

2. Over 5 years of PQE or quality engineering experience in manufacturing, preferably with experience in the tobacco, food, or chemical industries.

3. Familiar with manufacturing processes and quality management systems, with a solid foundation in quality control.

4. Proficient in quality tools (the seven QC tools, FMEA, SPC, etc.) with practical application experience.

5. Strong data analysis capabilities and the ability to independently resolve problems.

6. Possess strong communication and coordination skills; proficiency in English as a working language is preferred.

About SMOORE

SMOORE is a global leader in offering vaping technology solutions, including manufacturing vaping devices and vaping components for HNB products on an ODM basis, with advanced R&D technology, strong manufacturing capacity, wide-spectrum product portfolio, and diverse customer base.

SMOORE Indonesia has become a group and has 4 plants in Indonesia:

PT. Smoore Technology Indonesia - Malang

PT. Atomization Technology Indonesia - Pasuruan

PT. Merit Technology and Innovation Indonesia - Sidoarjo

PT. Genesis Technology Indonesia - Malang


Responsibilities:

1. Drive lean improvements in HNB production processes (efficiency, cost, yield);

2. Identify production bottlenecks and waste, lead the implementation of improvement projects;

3. Promote optimization of production stability and consistency (reduce variability);

4. Optimize production processes (VSM, standard time, line balancing);

5. Promote automation and semi-automation improvement projects;

6. Establish improvement mechanisms and monitor outcomes;


Requirements:

1. Bachelor's degree or higher, Industrial Engineering preferred;

2. Over 3 years of experience in lean production or continuous improvement;

3. Familiar with Lean, Six Sigma, and Industrial Engineering methodologies;

4. Experience in efficiency improvement or cost reduction projects;

5. Strong data analysis and logical thinking skills;

6. Proficient in English communication; experience in Tobacco, HNB, or Food industries preferred;

Kriteria:

Lulusan S1 atau S2, didahulukan bagi pelamar yang berpengalaman di bidang konstruksi

Menguasai Bahasa Mandarin secara aktif dan pasif

Memiliki kemampuan bersosialisasi dan komunikasi yang baik, koordinasi dan organisasi, kemampuan menganalisis dan penyelesaian masalah (problem-solving skill), serta memiliki kemampuan komunikasi dan public relation skill yang baik

Memiliki kemampuan analisis market yang tinggi, kemampuan beradaptasi/fleksibilitas tinggi, kemampuan berpikir kreatif serta kemampuan manajemen yang stabil

Memiliki rasa tanggung jawab terhadap pekerjaan yang tinggi, bekerja secara gesit dan efektif, dapat bekerja di bawah tekanan, memiliki kemampuan manajemen waktu yang baik

Aktif dan ceria, bersedia untuk melakukan perjalanan dinas, berpenampilan rapi




Tugas Pekerjaan:

Memiliki kemampuan menulis dokumen/artikel yang baik, bertanggung jawab untuk melakukan perumusan perihal aturan dan pengaturan manajemen umum dan standar bagi perusahaan;

Membantu mengumpulkan laporan-laporan penting, serta memeriksa data penting yang telah diterima, melakukan penilaian terhadap berbagai departemen berdasarkan hasil pencocokan dari data yang diterima, dan menerapkan reward dan punishment terhadap karyawan sesuai dengan hasil evaluasi kinerja;

Membantu Pimpinan mengkoordinir dan mengorganisir secara komprehensif seperti operasional perusahaan, pengadaan material, audit keuangan, manajemen admin dan personalia dll., serta menguasai kegiatan operasional dan bidang bisnis utama;

Membantu Pimpinan dalam memberikan informasi kelayakan secara hukum, analisis secara legalitas hukum dan analisis resiko hukum terkait dengan keputusan dalam kegiatan operasional dan manajemen perusahaan;

Meninjau, merevisi, dan menandatangani kontrak dan perjanjian ekonomi, dan mengawasi departemen fungsional perusahaan dan anak perusahaan dalam menjalankan kontrak dan perjanjian;

Dibawah bimbingan Pimpinan, bertanggung jawab atas pengaturan, pelaksanaan, pemeriksaan, pengawasan dan pelaksanaan pekerjaan terhadap manajemen perusahaan tertentu;

Melaksanakan dengan baik dan terorganisir catatan meeting Pimpinan dan rapat lainnya. Menyusun dan mengumumkan (publish) dokumen terkait resolusi dan keputusan serta dokumen lainnya.




Gaji akan disesuaikan dengan kemampuan dan pengalaman kandidat setelah melalui tahap interview.

Job Description

· Terbagi dalam 4 shift (minimal 2 orang per shift), dengan jadwal shift pagi, siang, malam, dan 1 shift off. Tugas dari shift engineer adalah sebagai berikut:
· Memiliki kemampuan first level support; · Melakukan monitoring dan maintenance perangkat server, network, security dan fasilitas Data Center, sesuai Standard of Procedure (SoP) yang ditentukan;
· Melakukan troubleshooting dan hand service (jika diperlukan), terhadap gangguan/problem di Data Center, sebagai first level support;
· Melakukan prosedur eskalasi masalah secara bertingkat;
· Melakukan monitoring sistem informasi di Data Center dan mengelola proses insiden respon secara positif dan proaktif;
· Memfasilitasi kegiatan maintenance sesuai dengan ketentuan layanan 7 hari x 24 jam x 365 hari untuk Managed Service fasilitas Data Center, IT Monitoring dan dukungan terhadap Service Level Agreement (SLA)

Qualification
· Minimal Pendidikan: D3 di bidang Teknik Elektro/Komputer/Informatika;
· Memiliki pengalaman mengelola operasi fasilitas data center.

Deskripsi Pekerjaan

Melakukan perencanaan & perancangan (desain) teknis bangunan terkait HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing sesuai standar yang berlaku;

Memahami gambar teknik dan prosedur pelaksanaan proyek konstruksi;

Melakukan inspeksi berkala dan pengecekan terakit instalasi HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing;

Melakukan survei lapangan untuk memperoleh data teknis & melakukan assisting pemasangan equipment & sistem HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing;

Berkolaborasi dengan Arsitek, Kontraktor, dan profesional lainnya di bidang konstruksi.




Kualifikasi

Lulusan SMK/D3 Teknik (MEP)

Memiliki minimal 2 tahun pengalaman kerja di bidang yang sama

Memiliki pengetahuan mengenai HVAC, Elektrikal, Mekanikal dan Plumbing

Mampu bekerja sama dalam tim, tahan terhadap tekanan, komunikatif dan memiliki kemampuan problem solving yang baik.

Menguasai AutoCAD, SketchUp dan software perencana lainnya

Frontend Engineer (Vue / Admin System)

Responsibilities

1. Develop and maintain frontend systems based on Vue;

2. Build and optimize admin dashboards (content review, data dashboards, task

management, etc.);

3. Integrate with backend APIs and implement data display and interaction logic;

4. Participate in UI structure design and user experience optimization;

5. Continuously improve frontend performance and code quality;




Requirements

1. At least 2 years of frontend development experience;

2. Strong proficiency in JavaScript / HTML / CSS;

3. Proficient in Vue (Vue 3 preferred) with solid component-based development skills;

4. Familiar with UI frameworks such as Element Plus or Ant Design Vue;

5. Experienced in API integration (Axios / Fetch) and frontend-backend separation;

6. Familiar with Git or other version control tools;

7. Good coding standards and development practices;




Core Competencies (Must Have)

1. Experience in building admin/backend management systems (key requirement);

2. Ability to independently implement common features such as lists, filtering, pagination, and state management;

3. Ability to understand business workflows (e.g., review processes, state transitions) and implement corresponding UI logic;

4. Ability to independently integrate with backend APIs and complete feature development;




Preferred Qualifications

1. Experience with data dashboards or charting tools (e.g., ECharts);

2. Experience with permission management systems (roles/menus);

3. Experience in e-commerce or content platforms;

4. Experience in frontend performance optimization;


Keywords

Vue3 / Admin System / API Integration / Data Dashboard / Content Review System

Product Manager (Content Platform / Data Platform)

Responsibilities

1.Responsible for the planning and design of the company’s content distribution platform (including content review, task distribution, and data analytics);

2.Design and optimize core business workflows (Creator Upload → Review → Publish → Data Collection → Settlement);

3.Produce high-quality product documentation (PRD), process flows, and prototypes;

4.Work closely with engineering teams (frontend & backend) to ensure efficient implementation of product requirements;

5.Track project progress, coordinate resources, and ensure timely delivery;

6.Continuously optimize product features and user experience based on data insights;

7.Participate in business strategy design (commission structure, creator management, content strategy, etc.);

Requirements

1.At least 2 years of experience as a product manager in internet companies; platform product experience is preferred;

2.Experience across the full product lifecycle (requirement analysis → design → launch → iteration);

3.Proficient in prototyping tools (such as Axure, Figma, etc.);

4.Strong logical thinking, capable of independently designing complex business workflows;

5.Excellent communication and coordination skills, able to drive cross-functional execution;

6.Basic data analysis skills, able to optimize products based on data;

7.Strong sense of ownership, execution ability, and adaptability in a fast-paced environment;

Core Competencies (Key Focus )

1.Ability to design complex workflow systems (e.g., review workflows, task flows, state transitions)

2.Strong understanding of platform-based business models (e.g., creator management, content distribution, data attribution)

3.Data-driven mindset (able to design metrics such as clicks, conversions, GMV, etc.)

4.Strong execution capability (not only writing documents, but also ensuring product delivery)

Preferred Qualifications

1.Experience in content platforms (short video / MCN);

2.Experience in e-commerce or commission-based systems;

3.Familiarity with TikTok or other social media platforms;

4.Experience with data platforms or BI systems;

C# Backend Engineer (API Integration)

1. Responsibilities

1. Develop and maintain backend systems based on C# (ASP.NET Core);

2. Integrate with third-party platform APIs (e.g., TikTok, Shopify);

3. Design and implement core business workflows (content moderation, task

processing, data handling, etc.);

4. Handle data collection, processing, and storage related to video/content;

5. Participate in system architecture design to improve scalability and stability;

6. Develop scheduled tasks, asynchronous jobs, and data synchronization processes;

7. Collaborate closely with frontend engineers and product managers to deliver

features efficiently.

2. Requirements

1. Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related field is preferred;

2. 3+ years of backend development experience;

3. Proficient in C# and familiar with ASP.NET Core (.NET 6 or above);

4. Strong understanding of RESTful API design and development;

5. Hands-on experience with third-party API integration (required);

6. Familiar with OAuth2 authentication and authorization mechanisms;

7. Experience with relational databases such as MySQL or PostgreSQL;

8. Familiar with Redis (caching, distributed locks, etc.);

9. Experience with NoSQL databases such as MongoDB is a plus;

10. Familiar with asynchronous programming (async/await) and task scheduling tools

(e.g., Hangfire / Quartz.NET);

11. Experience with message queues (e.g., RabbitMQ / Kafka) is a plus;

12. Basic knowledge of Linux and experience with Docker is preferred.

3. Preferred Qualifications

1. Experience with TikTok API or e-commerce platform APIs (e.g., Shopify);

2. Experience building content platforms, moderation systems, or distribution

systems;

3. Experience with data analytics, reporting, or commission systems;

4. Experience handling high-concurrency or large-scale data processing;

5. Experience in system architecture design or owning end-to-end projects.

4. We Expect You To Have

• Strong coding standards and engineering practices;

• Excellent problem-solving skills;

• Good communication and teamwork abilities;

• Strong execution and willingness to learn new technologies.

5. Keywords

C# / ASP.NET Core / API Integration / TikTok API / Shopify API / OAuth2 / Redis /

MongoDB / Async Jobs / Data Processing
